{"parse": {"title": "11TH-23", "pageid": 110491, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-22\" title=\"11TH-22\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">11TH-23</span><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-24\" title=\"11TH-24\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">11TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">23</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B5.A6.E5.85.8D.E4.BB.A4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"赦免令\">赦免令</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 赦免令</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Pardon</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>咖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>啡<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>甜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>亲<span class=\"color-value\"></span>族<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>关<span class=\"color-value\"></span>旧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>生<span class=\"color-value\"></span>活<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>回<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>及<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>串<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>暗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>锁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>链<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11123</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一次月升月落之后，屹立不倒的教堂再次接纳白昼的光明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此时已接近正午，草被绵软的庭院内依旧保持惯有的静谧，只不过此刻多了一份因静候而生的肃穆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>受企盼的人终于出现在林地边缘——她已经用一夜的时间处理好醒目的伤痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>玛丽，你回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她按捺住上前拥抱的念头——因为此时她正用双手端着一只装着咖啡与茶点的银盘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>咖啡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>没错，照你喜欢的——不加奶也不加糖。另外还有一些香草马卡龙和蒙布朗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于刚从战场上退下的士兵来说，这些食物与器皿的色彩营造了一种不真实的氛围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜从堂姨手中接过温热的咖啡，怀着不可思议的心情轻啜一口。<br />当然，不及巴黎咖啡馆的出品，但此刻亦是珍馐美味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>姨妈，这些是从哪里弄来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人双手握在一起，展露出一道有些哀婉的苦笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-528401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">石像鬼妇人：</div><div>看看谁来了，玛丽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她让出身子，玛丽安娜即刻注意到那久未得见的高大身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>玛丽安娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你为什么过来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>总统已经为你签发了赦免令，你可以回后方了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>另外，拉蒂斯病得不轻，在信仰问题上，他太钻牛角尖，我虽然预料到了这一天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他以略带不满的方式结束了话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>总而言之，我是来接你们离开的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>这么说，现在家里是你在管事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>泰内布朗热家在战争中损失惨重，需要有人在战后领导家族的重建。我正在重新与失散的家族成员取得联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>重塑之手尚未威胁到巴黎，我在蒙马特购置了几套房产，在重塑之手和基金会的冲突结束之前可供暂时居住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>泰内布朗热先生以不容置喙的姿态转身，面向艾格尼丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>艾格尼丝要送回鲁昂，安置在家族的墓地中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……墓地？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不能理解这个词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>艾格尼丝没有死，她只是……出于……拉蒂斯说的某些理由……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜抬起眼，对上父亲有些哀其不争的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>你从来都不尊重家族的传统，所以才会被拉蒂斯的疯言疯语所欺骗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>他撒谎了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>不，我相信他不会撒谎，只是在对灵知的探索中太过偏狭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>家族中没有任何记载表明，预兆会以这种奇怪的方式降临在我们的族人身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>艾格尼丝的“雕塑化”只是一个平凡的惨剧，没有任何隐秘或神圣的意味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>她只是因为太过害怕落在头上的炮火，才在未成熟的神秘术上失手，在石化中没有留下任何一丝血肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>这就是全部的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>你和拉蒂斯都把她看得太重，可艾格尼丝终究只是一个普通的孩子，并非天上降下的天使。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-526701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃曼努埃尔：</div><div>我也为此难过，但你必须相信，不会再有任何奇迹降临到艾格尼丝身上。她永远都只能是一座雕塑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父亲伸出手，轻轻拍了拍女儿已承担了许多重量的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父女没有再交谈什么，只是在艾格尼丝的“雕塑”前戚然沉吟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>泰内布朗热先生率先离开了，他还有更重要的事情要处理——教堂外已经停着好几辆搬家用的卡车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>颤巍巍的锁链声刺破了空气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>玛丽安娜，你竟然回来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教士步履蹒跚，似乎正在被什么无形的东西推搡着向玛丽安娜靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的手心捧着一串闪着寒光的锁链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>该死的，我以为父亲只是——你真的生病了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我生了病，那你呢，玛丽安娜？——你竟不知道自己陷入了比罹患疾病更可悲的境地中了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他吐出疯癫的言辞，完全失去了过往谨慎克制的谦逊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我在你身上看见了多么沉重的罪孽，可悲的人！而我也一样……一样……天啊，我在你身上嗅到了地狱的气味……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>你从地狱归来了，玛丽安娜……可悲的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>拉蒂斯，你真的疯了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>到巴黎之后，去找一个安静的疗养院吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯狡黠地眯起眼，像一个正在分享秘密的孩童。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我也许会乖乖在疗养院休养，但你不想回去，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……我还没有决定……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>不……不！你不能回去，你永远不能再回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我和别人不一样，能在你身上看见特别的东西……你已经不再是——不再是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>恶魔……萦绕在家族之血中的恶魔，它睁开了眼睛……它的眼睛——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉蒂斯发出痛苦的哀嚎，浑身颤抖不止，手中的锁链也连带着撞出更加刺耳的噪音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>不能回头了！你已经不能回头……你的路在外面，不在里面……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>但是……但是我想帮助你，我的堂亲。我会帮助所有人，但尤其是你，以偿还我的罪孽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他止住了颤抖，以极尽恭顺的姿态低下瘦长的身躯，将手中的锁链捧在玛丽安娜眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>——拉蒂斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>这是束缚灵魂的枷锁……牢笼。是的，但我恳求你能将它收下……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-526012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我会奉献我的一生为你的灵魂祈祷，堂亲，日日夜夜，愿你的灵魂不至于永堕黑暗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-312601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-526001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>愿你的血洁净，洒向大地，新的土地将因此繁茂。愿你走在地狱的路上，依旧念着神圣的名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又是一份不轻的负累，它将时刻提醒拥有者可施加之恶的极限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>如果我不接受这份镣铐呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>我的祈祷也不会因此停歇，一如过往的一切时日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾格尼丝如同在静默地倾听着这一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉蒂斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，她取走了锁链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冰冷的金属垂在手中，如有千钧之重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>告诉我父亲，我不回去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>——除非战争有真正结束的那一天。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "11TH-23"}}